<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Sept 12.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Sept 12.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twenty highest dividend yields for Australian companies included in the 320-share All Ordinaries Index based on closing prices on September 11.</p>
<p>Dividends based on rolling 12 months.</p>
<p>Yields are not grossed up for franking credits.</p>
<p>				 Dividend</p>
<p>Rank Name		    Yield     Close</p>
<p>1  Kalamazoo Hlds	  19.49     2.36</p>
<p>2  Central Norseman	13.33     0.90</p>
<p>3  Telecasters Nqld	13.33     5.25</p>
<p>4  Pac Mutual Aust	 12.45     2.41</p>
<p>5  Kurts (P) Prop	  10.34     1.45</p>
<p>6  Blackmores Lab	  10.32     3.10</p>
<p>7  Prime Credit Tr	 10.32     0.95</p>
<p>8  Indu Property	   10.11     0.90</p>
<p>9  Prop Income Inv	  9.91     1.03</p>
<p>10 Colonial Mutual	  9.89     1.07</p>
<p>11 BT Prop Trust	    9.83     1.66</p>
<p>12 Multistack		 9.68     0.31</p>
<p>13 Villa World		9.62     1.04</p>
